	(text "J402 = front-panel system connector (10-way KK-254): 1 ENC_A, 2 GND, 3 ENC_B, 4 ENC_SW, 5 GND, 6 PWR_LED+, 7 BT_LED+, 8 GND (LED -), 9 CHG_LED+, 10 CHG_LED- (BQ STAT). LED series resistors are on this board (R509, R505, R106). Twisted lead, keep short."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 218.44 0)
		(effects
